# lib/constructs/patterns

Reusable infrastructure patterns that are not specific to one domain of this application — for
example `StaticWebSite`, `QueueProcessor`, or a standardised Lambda function with the project's
logging, tracing and IAM conventions baked in.

Promote a construct here when it is used by more than one domain, or when it exists to enforce a
project standard. Keep domain-specific constructs in `lib/constructs/<domain>/`.

Do not create a pattern that only wraps a single L2 construct without adding configuration,
validation or a project decision — the indirection costs more than it saves.
